                <pb facs="0666" n="556" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg556"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.51/1981: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Eberhardt</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-08-14T19:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 14,
                                1928—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>163. Your 303, August 7, 10 a.m. Department has again communicated with bankers
                    who prefer to reserve decision about giving out Financial Plan until Rosenthal
                    arrives.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
